{
  "source": "usage-admin (删除前，独立 FastAPI 服务，前缀 /admin/v1)",
  "frozen_at": "2026-09-17",
  "note": "合并进 factory-agent 统计面之前的接口形状快照，取自 git 历史里的 usage-admin/api/*.py。测试只读本文件与当前 statistics_router 的 OpenAPI，不 import 已删除的 usage_admin 包。用于守住 ADR-0003 的「契约可控变更」：除 intended_changes 列出的四处外，其余路径、参数、请求体、状态码与出参字段必须逐一致。",
  "intended_changes": {
    "prefix": {
      "from": "/admin/v1",
      "to": "/v1/statistics"
    },
    "path_param": {
      "from": "{app_key}",
      "to": "{tenant_ref}"
    },
    "response_field_added": {
      "model": "RegistryItemOut",
      "field": "tenant_ref"
    },
    "query_param_added": {
      "param": "query:tenant_ref",
      "note": "精确工厂过滤改按非密句柄 tenant_ref（原先要客户端持有明文 AppKey）。by-tenant 上原 query:app_key 仍留在签名里，但任何取值都会 422：宁可报错，也不让旧客户端静默失去筛选。其余聚合端点此前没有工厂过滤，本次一并铺开，全部走同一个 tenant_ref 句柄。",
      "endpoints": [
        "/v1/statistics/usage/summary",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/timeseries",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/dimensions",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/users",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/mes-categories",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/mes-failures",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/mes-operations",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/models",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/capabilities",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/errors",
        "/v1/statistics/usage/by-tenant"
      ]
    },
    "response_model_changed": {
      "path": "/v1/statistics/tenants",
      "method": "get",
      "from": "array of string（时间范围内有数据租户的明文 AppKey）",
      "to": "array of TenantOptionView",
      "model": "TenantOptionView",
      "fields": [
        "tenant_ref",
        "tenant_name"
      ],
      "note": "用量看板的工厂选择器不再下发明文密钥，改发非密句柄与工厂名；未登记（无句柄可寻址）的租户从选择器中略去。"
    }
  },
  "retired_paths": [
    "/health/live",
    "/health/ready"
  ],
  "retired_schemas": [
    "HealthResponse"
  ],
